# 🏛️ NAV Domain Scorecard – Queries & Formulas

**Purpose:** Executable SQL queries and formulas for Scorecard generation.

---

## Intra-Domain Queries

```sql
SELECT
    mission_id,
    -- Vertical Stability
    ROUND(STDDEV(RelHomeAlt),3) AS alt_jitter_m,
    -- Horizontal Velocity
    ROUND(AVG(Spd),2) AS avg_groundspeed_ms,
    ROUND(MAX(Spd),2) AS max_groundspeed_ms,
    -- Signal Integrity
    CAST(AVG(NSats) AS INT) AS avg_sats,
    ROUND(MAX(HDop),2) AS max_hdop,
    -- Mission Duration
    ROUND(MAX(mission_time)-MIN(mission_time),1) AS duration_sec
FROM fact_nav
GROUP BY mission_id;

SELECT
    mission_id,
    ROUND(STDDEV(RelHomeAlt), 3) AS alt_jitter_m,
    ROUND(AVG(Spd), 2) AS avg_groundspeed_ms,
    ROUND(MAX(Spd), 2) AS max_groundspeed_ms,
    ROUND(MAX(ABS(VZ)), 2) AS max_vertical_rate_ms,
    CAST(AVG(NSats) AS INT) AS avg_sats,
    ROUND(MAX(HDop), 2) AS max_hdop,
    ROUND(MAX(Lat)-MIN(Lat), 5) AS lat_spread_deg,
    ROUND(MAX(Lng)-MIN(Lng), 5) AS lng_spread_deg,
    ROUND(MAX(mission_time) - MIN(mission_time), 1) AS duration_sec
FROM fact_nav
GROUP BY mission_id;
```
| Information Goal     | DuckDB Formula                                  |
| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Vertical Stability   | `ROUND(STDDEV(RelHomeAlt),3)`                   |
| Horizontal Velocity  | `ROUND(AVG(Spd),2)`, `ROUND(MAX(Spd),2)`        |
| Vertical Performance | `MAX(ABS(VZ))`                                  |
| Signal Integrity     | `CAST(AVG(NSats) AS INT)`, `ROUND(MAX(HDop),2)` |
| Trajectory Volume    | `MAX(Lat)-MIN(Lat)`, `MAX(Lng)-MIN(Lng)`        |
| Mission Duration     | `ROUND(MAX(mission_time)-MIN(mission_time),1)`  |
| Attitude State       | `Q1-Q4`                                         |

## Inter-Domain Queries (NAV + SYS / POWER / EST)

SELECT
    n.mission_time,
    -- Vertical Accuracy
    ROUND(ABS(n.RelHomeAlt - s.DAlt),3) AS alt_error_m,
    -- Transit Efficiency
    CASE WHEN n.Spd>1 THEN ROUND(p.Curr/n.Spd,3) ELSE 0 END AS amps_per_ms,
    -- Mechanical Stress
    s.VibeZ,
    -- Estimation Trust
    e.PE AS pos_error_estimate,
    -- Energy Cost
    CASE WHEN n.Spd>1 THEN ROUND(p.CurrTot/n.Spd,3) ELSE 0 END AS energy_per_ms
FROM fact_nav n
ASOF LEFT JOIN fact_sys s ON n.mission_time >= s.mission_time
ASOF LEFT JOIN fact_power p ON n.mission_time >= p.mission_time
ASOF LEFT JOIN fact_est e ON n.mission_time >= e.mission_time
LIMIT 100;

| Information Goal   | DuckDB Formula                                               |
| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |
| Vertical Accuracy  | `ROUND(ABS(n.RelHomeAlt - s.DAlt),3)`                        |
| Mechanical Stress  | `s.VibeZ`                                                    |
| Transit Efficiency | `CASE WHEN n.Spd>1 THEN ROUND(p.Curr/n.Spd,3) ELSE 0 END`    |
| Estimation Trust   | `e.PE`                                                       |
| Energy Cost        | `CASE WHEN n.Spd>1 THEN ROUND(p.CurrTot/n.Spd,3) ELSE 0 END` |
| Command Response   | (Correlation C1-C4 vs trajectory, computed in SQL/Analysis)  |

```sql
SELECT
    n.mission_time,
    ROUND(ABS(n.RelHomeAlt - s.DAlt), 3) AS alt_error_m,
    CASE WHEN n.Spd > 1 THEN ROUND(p.Curr / n.Spd, 3) ELSE 0 END AS amps_per_ms,
    s.VibeZ,
    e.PE AS pos_error_estimate,
    n.Spd,
    n.VZ,
    p.CurrTot,
    c.C1, c.C2, c.C3, c.C4
FROM fact_nav n
ASOF LEFT JOIN fact_sys s ON n.mission_time >= s.mission_time
ASOF LEFT JOIN fact_power p ON n.mission_time >= p.mission_time
ASOF LEFT JOIN fact_est e ON n.mission_time >= e.mission_time
ASOF LEFT JOIN fact_communication c ON n.mission_time >= c.mission_time
LIMIT 100;
```

